{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>The voice</b> and <b>salvation</b> — because he mentioned, \"You pushed me hard\" (בראשית י\"ג ד') [sic]." "The sense of <b>in the tents of the righteous</b> — that they will be secure from the death of those who seek their harm; then they will say [it]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 118, :notes {0 "The citation appears corrupt: Genesis 13:4 has no relevance here. Ibn Ezra seems to be referencing Psalms 118:13 (דחיתני לנפול, 'you pushed me hard to fall'), not Genesis 13:4; the citation is translated literally as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:01.044615175Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}